  "notes": [
    "nic2008 gives NIC 2008 divisions (two digits; '10-33' means all manufacturing). NIC 2008 follows ISIC Rev.4, so the same codes work internationally.",
    "vishwakarma lists the PM Vishwakarma trades that fall in each sub-sector; all 18 trades are placed.",
    "NCO 2015 occupation codes for the informal track are not yet added per cell.",
    "crs codes are OECD DAC purpose codes; verify against the current CRS list before using them for reporting.",
    "csr refs are slugs of csr_sector tags loaded from reference_data.sql."
  ]
